Changes: use indexOf/slice for list first-line extraction; guard inline
recognizers by their starting character; directly emit plain inline text;
simplify GFM text scanning when email or URL introducers are absent; skip
identity emphasis-mask replacements and tab-free list indentation expansion;
replace temporary Unicode spread arrays in emphasis processing with direct
code point operations. A new fixed-path JSON driver runs the parser for the
make.fun markdown-render-speed-02 competition.
